Prince of Persia 2 scaffold 0.1 (12.10.2026)

Development scaffold, not a playable game or a supported game installation.
Requires PAL AGA and a 68020 or later. The empty executable takes over the
hardware for four fields, restores the OS, and returns to the Shell.
Test configuration: A1200, 2 MB Chip, 8 MB Fast. Final RAM requirement unmeasured.

Run PrinceOfPersia2 from the Amiga Shell. The included KickEmu slave is scaffold
source/build infrastructure; WHDLoad execution and installation are not validated.
The future installer must extract and verify the user's matching original archive.
No originals, ROMs, Kickstart, WHDLoad binary, saves or captured data are included.

Credits: Vesa Halttunen; reusable runtime and platform code from Alone in the Dark;
dA JoRMaS hardware framework via AmigaXDev; public-domain C2P by Mikael Kalms.
See repository docs/scaffold.md and the source provenance manifests.
